# Files that must exist in dist/ but must never be served.
#
# `wrangler deploy --assets` uploads this directory as the public asset store,
# which is every file in it, including ones written by the build for the
# build's own use. Same format as .gitignore; the files stay on disk for the
# scripts that read them and for the deployment artifact.
#
# _headers and _redirects are excluded by wrangler already and need no entry.

# Vite's build manifest. Names every source module in the app, and is read
# after the build by report-bundle.ts, verify-pwa-output.ts and adaptive-assets.ts.
.vite/

# Build evidence: the bundle delivery graph and the PWA precache report,
# written by report-bundle.ts and verify-pwa-output.ts and read back by the
# performance tooling. Internal measurements, not part of the site.
performance/
